    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense for basic entries, but we're finding that some of these maps seem to feature very strange or non-humanoid figures and symbols that don't match any known historical records. When we encounter these \"unidentifiable\" elements or creators that seem almost out of place in the historical context, how should we record that in the metadata? Are there specific controlled vocabularies for things that don't fit standard human/historical classifications?",
